---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Eichenberg & Associates collects, uses and protects information submitted through this site.">
  <article class="wrap" style="max-width:780px;padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,104px)">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p><h1 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px)">What we collect, and why</h1>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:16px">Last updated: PLACEHOLDER (date) · Draft for legal review before publishing.</p>
    <div class="legal">
      <section><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Eichenberg &amp; Associates (“we,” “us”) provides change management services. This policy explains what information we collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices you have. Questions: <a href="mailto:jennifer@eichenbergassociates.com">jennifer@eichenbergassociates.com</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>What we collect</h2><p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you use the contact form or a landing-page form, we collect what you enter: name, work email, company, title, your situation, and your answers to the questions on that page, including your place on the “who can lead it, who can do it” grid.</p><p><strong>Newsletter.</strong> If you subscribe or request a guide, we store your email address and the source of the signup.</p><p><strong>Technical data.</strong> Our forms are protected by Cloudflare Turnstile, which may process your IP address and browser signals to tell people from bots. We store a one-way hash of your IP address with form submissions for abuse prevention. We use cookieless analytics (Plausible) that count visits without identifying you.</p></section>
      <section><h2>How we use it</h2><p>To reply to your inquiry and, if you choose, to schedule a call. To send you the guide you requested and, if you subscribed, the monthly newsletter. To run our sales process: your submission is stored in our private dashboard and may be tracked through the stages of a conversation with us. To keep the site secure and understand how it is used.</p><p>We do not sell your information. We do not send marketing email without your say-so.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Who we share it with</h2><p>Service providers that run the site on our behalf: hosting (Netlify), database (Supabase), email delivery (Resend), spam protection (Cloudflare), scheduling (Calendly, when you book), newsletter delivery (PLACEHOLDER: provider), and analytics (Plausible). Each processes data only as needed to provide its service. We may disclose information if required by law.</p></section>
      <section><h2>How long we keep it</h2><p>Inquiry and lead records are kept while a conversation is active and for up to PLACEHOLDER (e.g. 36 months) afterward, then deleted or anonymized. Newsletter addresses are kept until you unsubscribe. Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe link.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Your choices and rights</h2><p>You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the information we hold about you, or to stop contacting you, at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:jennifer@eichenbergassociates.com">jennifer@eichenbergassociates.com</a>. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under laws such as the GDPR or state privacy laws; we will honor valid requests.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Cookies</h2><p>This site does not use advertising or tracking cookies. Essential cookies are used only to keep the administrator signed in to the private dashboard.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Security</h2><p>Data is transmitted over HTTPS and stored with access limited to Eichenberg &amp; Associates. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure; if a breach affects your information we will notify you as required by law.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Children</h2><p>This site is for business audiences and is not directed to anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest revision; material changes will be noted on this page.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>.legal{margin-top:40px;display:grid;gap:28px}.legal h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.15}.legal p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}</style>
